BREAKING NEWS!

A strange phenomenon has the village of Wiesental in a tight grip.

Like every night, residents have gone to bed and fallen asleep - only to never wake up again. 

An older female and an adult male have fallen into unexplicable slumber. The local Dr.  has not given any statement on these incidents, except that it might be chemically induced.

Is there something strange in the air? Is the doctor hiding something from the public? Or is the folktale of The Sandman, a tiny sleep inducing creature, the one to blame?


